{"notes":[{"n":1,"lesson":"too + adjective means beyond ability","file":false},{"n":2,"lesson":"far away, not distant, for origin","file":false},{"n":3,"lesson":"why clause, not plot that","file":false},{"n":4,"lesson":"state uses was, not went","file":false},{"n":5,"lesson":"furious about, not for","file":true,"phrase":"furious about","ended":"I’m on the early chapters of Darktail’s Judgment, and I get a little bit confused about why StarClan didn’t show up when Darkpaw was at the moonstone and he was really miserable and <m>furious about</m> it.","meaning":"因某事而愤怒、非常生气。","usage":"用于说明愤怒的原因，后面接事情或名词，如 furious about the ending。比 furious for that 更自然，for 不用于这个搭配。","examples":[{"t":"Many readers were <m>furious about</m> how the Darkpaw arc ended.","n":"很多读者对Darkpaw那条线的结局非常愤怒。"},{"t":"My brother is still <m>furious about</m> the phone he broke last week.","n":"我哥哥至今还为上周摔坏的那部手机生气。"},{"t":"The neighbors were <m>furious about</m> the noise last night.","n":"邻居们对昨晚的噪音非常生气。"}]},{"n":6,"lesson":"an before vowel sound","file":false},{"n":7,"lesson":"it makes sense that, a natural formula","file":true,"phrase":"it makes sense that","ended":"But it was mentioned in the book that it was an overcast day, so without the moonlight <m>it makes sense that</m> they couldn’t reach StarClan back then when the Clans were still in the forest.","meaning":"这样想或这样发生是合理的、说得通的。","usage":"用来解释某种结果为什么合理，后面接完整句子。比 it’s natural to be unable to 更地道，也更符合英语的表达习惯。","examples":[{"t":"Without the moonlight, <m>it makes sense that</m> the Clans lost their connection to StarClan.","n":"没有月光的时候，部族与星族失去联系也说得通。"},{"t":"<m>It makes sense that</m> the shop is closed on Sundays.","n":"这家店周日关门，这说得通。"},{"t":"<m>It makes sense that</m> she’s nervous before her first job interview.","n":"她第一次面试前紧张，这很合理。"}]},{"n":8,"lesson":"where for places and situations","file":false},{"n":9,"lesson":"was for past situation","file":false},{"n":10,"lesson":"a cat, not some cat’s","file":false},{"n":11,"lesson":"try again, a basic phrase","file":false}]}
